DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Kid Creator Fall Market
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday in October\, pop into Dancing Bear Toys and Games to experience our Fall Market from 12 pm-4 pm! We are very excited to create this opportunity for kid creators to sell their creations and give the community a chance to support young entrepreneurs + business owners! Each Sunday you’ll find one kid creator selling their creations during time slots. See the schedule below! Fall Market Schedule: Sunday\, October 4: 12 pm-2 pm: Berklee (kandi creations and buttons) 2 pm-4 pm: Beads by the Bay (phone charms\, bracelets\, and fidgets) Sunday\, October 11: 12 pm-2 pm: Winston’s Wacky Fidget Factory (3D printed fidgets) 2 pm-4 pm: Nora’s Creations (kandi/pony beaded keychains and bracelets\, caterpillar chapstick holders\, buttons and pins) Sunday\, October 18: 12 pm-2 pm: Kalm Kidz (sensory bins) 2 pm-4 pm: Knotty Swag (paracord accessories including bracelets\, key chains\, water bottle holders and car hooks) Sunday\, October 25: 12 pm-2 pm: Avery (jars of slimes)
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/kid-creator-fall-market/26174/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventlutherrelives3aanighttoremember25966-20261011@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261011T161437Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Luther Re-Lives: A Night to Remember
DESCRIPTION:Luther Vandross remains one of the greatest vocalists of all time\, and his music continues to inspire audiences worldwide. Luther Relives brings his iconic sound\, style\, and soul back to the stage\, featuring William “Smooth” Wardlaw backed by an exceptional live band and powerful vocalists. Performing to sold-out audiences around the world\, Luther Relives is an outstanding tribute to Vandross and his contributions to R&B\, soul\, and disco music. “I could see it over and over again and still enjoy it better than the first time! Mr. Luther II rocked the house and so did his backups and the incredible band members… If you don’t get to see them\, you are really missing out—big time. They really give their all and more!” – Goldstar Learn more about this event at the official Luther Relives website.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/luther-re-lives%3a-a-night-to-remember/25966/
END:VEVENT
