DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Reception for Artists\, Pauline Rakis and Galina Kolosovskaya\, for their exhibit of: “Kitchen Art: Where Folks Gather”
DESCRIPTION:A reception for the artists\, Pauline Rakis and Galina Kolosovskaya\, will be held in the Tasting Room of Links Bridge Vineyards on Sunday October 11. Artists Pauline Rakis and Galena Kolosovskaya have distinctively different painting styles. Kolosovskaya is a representational\, classical artist who works in oil. Rakis is an impressionist-driven acrylic and collage artist. Both enjoy working with strong colors and shapes. Both artists will be on hand from 1 pm to 3 pm to talk about their work. This exhibit is all about providing that inspiration to get people to expand their creativity in the kitchen beyond cooking and embrace kitchen art. The exhibit is open to the public every Saturday and Sunday from 11 am to 6 pm from October 3 through November 1st and is open by appointment on the weekdays.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/reception-for-artists-pauline-rakis-and-galina-kolosovskaya-for-their-exhibit-of%3a-%e2%80%9ckitchen-art%3a-where-folks-gather%e2%80%9d/26009/
END:VEVENT
