DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Sunday Scaries: Record Pop-Up
DESCRIPTION:Need a cure for the Sunday Scaries? We’ve got just the thing: craft beer\, purchasable vinyl\, and live music! We’re partnering with The Record Exchange to transform Sandbox Brewhouse into a pop-up record shop\, accompanied by a fantastic lineup of vinyl and digital DJs curated by Brain Dead Live! and Portal 6. With sets from Jjaro\, Austin Litz\, Kokop3lli\, Brooce\, and Zzingg\, our stage will feature a continuously rotating mix of styles to keep the energy fresh all afternoon. Fair warning: you might end up staying the whole day...
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/sunday-scaries%3a-record-pop-up/26204/
END:VEVENT
