SUMMARY:Unveiling Ceremony: Ron Young Sculptural Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate the visionary leadership that advanced an innovative flood control project protecting the City of Frederick from flooding and allowing the development of the Carroll Creek Linear Park and all that surrounds it. A statue of the visionary leader\, former Mayor Ron Young\, will be unveiled at the amphitheater along with wayside signage describing the history. The vision included public art\, community gathering\, and economic redevelopment. Nationally renowned sculptor Antonio Tobias Mendez \\
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/unveiling-ceremony%3a-ron-young-sculptural-tribute/26161/
END:VEVENT
