SUMMARY:Bakery Pop Up Sale at Hospitality\, Culinary & Tourism Institute (HCTI)
DESCRIPTION:Stop by the Monroe Center to shop fresh-baked goods made on site by our Hospitality\, Culinary & Tourism Institute (HCTI) students—including chocolate chip cookies\, scones\, blueberry muffins\, eclairs\, lemon tarts\, soft pretzels\, focaccia\, assorted breads\, opera cake\, Danishes\, croissants\, homemade soups\, and more. Proceeds from the sale support HCTI student scholarships.
